{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1355671-monsters-paintings","id":1355671,"title":"Monsters & Paintings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-18T11:55:55-08:00","id":1355671,"title":"Monsters & Paintings","content":"I preparing crossover open game where painting \u2013 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byzantine_art\" target=\"_blank\">religious Icons</a>, to be precise \u2013 will be important, set in Byzantine Empire. Because of having brainstorm so ideas for it \u2013 and need probably few more \u2013 I started with topic. I wondered to it to titled \u2018Monsters &amp; Art\u2019, but thought it would be too broad with sculpture, music, dance, and every field of art. Let\u2019s focus on what can your monsters do to images \u2013 on walls or in frames, for example.<br /> <br /> Here are my ideas\u2026 <b>Vampires</b><br /><br /> Lances Sanctum are famous for collecting Icons of various sorts \u2013 and creating them. Connecting their worship of various saints with general attitude of collectors and archaeologists of Kindred, Sanctified have vast collections of sacred paintings. Rumors says they can even imbue image with divine by their dark miracles. <b>Werewolves</b><br /><br /> Fetishes are items infused with Essence, energy of emotions. Those that worship sacred paintings generate Essence for them. Uratha constantly find powerful fetishes in those pieces of art. Bone Shadows and Hunters of Darkness are most interested in those, followed by Iron Masters.<br /> <br /> Some spirits are also bounded to their image, locked in it. <b>Mechanics:</b><br /><br /> Forcing prison on the image would be Fetter Condition by ritual? <b>Mages</b><br /><br /> Icons as Artifacts and Imbued Items, simple. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Beasts</b><br /><br /> Begotten are interested in human psychics and symbols \u2013 and those of sacred paintings are very much resonating with humans souls. <b>Mechanics:</b><br /><br /> I think about some Merit or Birthright that would beast to slip part of their Horrors aura in to the painting itself. It\u2019s still vague idea, without details, for now\u2026 <b>Ghosts &amp; Geists</b><br /><br /> Paintings of person can be her\u2019s ghosts ( and Geist ) powerful Anchor. <b>Others</b><br /><br /> You got some yours ideas?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}